# Analytics
# Both tokens are public (they're embedded in the deployed JS). Safe to commit
# the actual values if you prefer, but using env vars keeps them out of git.
#
# 1) Cloudflare Web Analytics
#    Get this from https://dash.cloudflare.com → Analytics & Logs → Web Analytics
#    → your site → "JavaScript snippet" → copy the `token` field.
PUBLIC_CF_ANALYTICS_TOKEN=

# 2) Microsoft Clarity
#    Get this from https://clarity.microsoft.com → your project → Settings
#    → Setup → copy the project ID (an alphanumeric string ~10 chars).
PUBLIC_CLARITY_PROJECT_ID=
